"""خدمة مطابقة أرصدة العملاء والموردين للواجهة: تغليف رقيق لمحرك business.party_reconcile (لا منطق محاسبي هنا)."""
from alhisabat.business import party_reconcile as pr


class ReconcileService:
    KINDS = {'عملاء': 'customer', 'موردون': 'supplier'}

    def __init__(self, session):
        self.s = session

    def read(self, path):
        self.s.require('data.import')
        return pr.read_reconcile_file(path)

    def currencies(self):
        from alhisabat.ui.core import readmodel
        return [c for c in readmodel.currencies_list(self.s.conn, self.s.company_id) if c['is_enabled']]

    def preview(self, kind_label, rows, as_of, currency=None, force=False, dup_mode='skip'):
        return pr.preview(self.s.conn, self.s.user_id, self.s.company_id, self.KINDS[kind_label], rows,
                          as_of=as_of, currency=currency, force_currency=force, dup_mode=dup_mode)

    def export(self, preview_result, path):
        return pr.export_xlsx(preview_result, path)

    def commit(self, kind_label, rows, as_of, currency=None, force=False, dup_mode='skip', post=False, note=''):
        return pr.commit(self.s.conn, self.s.user_id, self.s.company_id, self.KINDS[kind_label], rows,
                         as_of=as_of, currency=currency, force_currency=force, post=post, note=note, dup_mode=dup_mode)

    @staticmethod
    def confident(prev, min_score=0.9):
        return pr.confident_matches(prev, min_score)

    @staticmethod
    def parse_amount(text):
        return pr.parse_amount(text)
